# Bullet delegate key: hex-encoded 32-byte ed25519 seed.
# Generate with: go run ./cmd/perps-bench accounts generate --venues bullet --out .env.bullet.local
# Then register the printed delegate public key at app.bullet.xyz.
BULLET_DELEGATE_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Main Bullet account address from the webapp. Reads and the user.orders
# topic key on this address, not the delegate address.
BULLET_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=
# There is no env var for the REST or WebSocket host: no code reads
# BULLET_BASE_URL or BULLET_WS_URL. The network is chosen by the `network`
# builder param in the run config, alongside the Go-side endpoint. See
# internal/venues/bullet/README.md.
#
# The Bullet builder runs under Node: run `npm ci` in internal/venues/bullet
# before the first live run.
